<div class="col-md-6 col-main">
<h1 class="sdg-text-health">Health &amp; Living</h1>

<p>KMITL has a medical clinic, the service provided by KMITL medical clinic is to provide care, prevention, treatment and advice regarding taking care of own heath and local community heath.</p>

<p>The institute has many sports for students, staffs, and general publics from the surrounding community. The sports facilities of the institution are both free and inexpensive. </p>
</div>

<div class="mb-3 col-md-6 col-sidebar">
<ul class="ul-remove-style d-flex"><li class="p-2">
	<div class="align-center">
  
  
